# Layers

Pages + features compose. Services never import data or features. Only `services/shopify` talks to Shopify. No `workflows/` folder.

```
page / feature    → data, services, stores
data              → dto, services
dto               → (pure)
services          → utilities
stores            → utilities
```

| Layer | Owns |
|-------|------|
| `src/pages/` | Routes (thin), static |
| `src/features/` | Visitor jobs, UI |
| `src/data/<Entity>/` | `get*Server` / `get*Client`, Shopify node → view-model transform (`dto`) |
| `src/services/shopify/` | Storefront API client + GraphQL documents. Only place that calls Shopify |
| `src/stores/` | Client stores (cart id) |
| `src/utilities/` | Pure helpers |

No `domain/` yet: Shopify owns every business rule (pricing, stock, order lifecycle). Add `src/domain/<entity>/` only when this repo grows a rule of its own.

See `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`.
